the given sets is equivalent to $S,$ we start by listing the elements of $S,$ ignoring any duplicates:\n\n$$\nu,\\,v,\\,w,\\,x\n$$\n\nTherefore, the only set equivalent to $S$ is ${x,u,v,w}$ since it contains the same elements as $S.$\n\nThe other sets are not equivalent to $S:$\n\n- ${u,v,w}$ is missing the element $x.$\n\n- ${u,w,x}$ is missing the element $v.$\n\n- ${{u},w,x}$ is missing the elements $u$ and $v.$ Note that ${u}\\ne u.$\n\n- ${{u},{w},{v},x}$ is missing the elements $u,w$ and $v.$ Note that ${u}\\ne u,{w}\\ne w,$ and ${v}\\ne v.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-181619/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2eb8c35b-b52f-544e-be33-798406a23ade"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-181619"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-181613/selection/d58a42b611360f3ce24a234012275648d63c3e65d104ef794490b8d77d8a295f" :answer/id #uuid "9c4a5957-beed-5f26-ab4b-ce8391208032" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{1,3,6,9,12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181613/selection/3c53fb3d96549b7d1bd880cace6fb0d4ad5bfc098a01d4e06fce106740ca0de2" :answer/id #uuid "34f2935d-2586-5bf0-96ed-35617e26492a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{3,6,{12}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181613/selection/a4d541ac3f665c4e6145cac860c05936e99b9d68c4f3c7ad2c911667f05dca50" :answer/id #uuid "ded600e0-f7a3-53db-bd01-c79d065eb3f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{3,6,9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181613/selection/0f49249d126e23e4cdf6f058bac811c845b2b71af470a14c35997e37676a5d8f" :answer/id #uuid "409761b5-020c-5990-b65f-e410a01fbeec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{6,12,9,3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181613/selection/5de5123eb1c94e2ea7b672b443cbf49bd9599bf84a4663bae6357277ceddc01c" :answer/id #uuid "79fc7376-27e7-555b-a317-c1ecae44d08a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{3,6,9},12